<details id="change-of-employer-details" class="govuk-details" data-module="govuk-details">
    <summary class="govuk-details__summary">
        <span class="govuk-details__summary-text">
            Help with changes to learner's employer
        </span>
    </summary>
    <div class="govuk-details__text">

        <p class="govuk-body">
            If an learner you're training needs to move to a new employer, you should:
        </p>

        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
            <li>contact their original employer and ask them to stop the learner record.</li>
            <li>
                speak to the new employer to agree new training dates and price.
            </li>
            <li>request permission to move the learner to the new employer’s Apprenticeship Service account.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Once you've agreed these details, you can change the employer.</p>

        <p>
            Non-levy employers will not need to reserve funding when taking on a learner from another employer.
        </p>
    </div>
</details>